---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Beyond Panama Relocation privacy policy — what we collect, how we use it, and your rights." lang="en">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <a href="/en/" class="text-jade text-sm hover:underline">← Home</a>
    <header class="mt-4 mb-10">
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl text-slate mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-mid text-sm">Last updated: September 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none space-y-8 text-slate-mid leading-relaxed">

      <p>Beyond Panama Relocation ("Beyond Panama", "we", "us") respects your privacy. This page explains honestly what data we collect, why we collect it, and your rights over it. If you have questions, use our <a href="/en/contact" class="text-jade hover:underline">contact form</a>.</p>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-3">1. Data we collect</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">We collect only what you voluntarily give us:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li><strong class="text-slate">Quiz responses:</strong> When you complete the relocation quiz, we may collect your email address (if you request the guide) and your answers to orient our response. Responses are not linked to your identity unless you provide contact info.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-slate">Contact form:</strong> Name, email address, topic selection, and the message you write.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-slate">Analytics:</strong> We may use privacy-respecting analytics (e.g. page views, country of origin) that do not track you individually and do not use cookies that require consent under GDPR.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm">We do not collect sensitive personal data (health, financial accounts, government IDs, etc.).</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-3">2. How we use your data</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li>To send the relocation guide or resources you requested.</li>
          <li>To respond to your specific question via the contact form.</li>
          <li>Occasionally, to share updates or new content related to moving to Panama — you can unsubscribe at any time.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm">We do not sell, rent, or trade your information to third parties. Full stop.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-3">3. Referrals and third-party professionals</h2>
        <p class="text-sm">If you decide to move forward with a legal or real estate process, Beyond Panama may connect you with a qualified professional (immigration lawyer, real estate agent) upon your request. In that case, Beyond Panama may receive a referral fee from the professional — at no additional cost to you. We only refer professionals we would recommend to a friend. Your contact details are only shared with a professional if you explicitly ask us to make the introduction.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-3">4. Cookies</h2>
        <p class="text-sm">This site uses minimal cookies necessary for basic functionality. We do not use advertising cookies or cross-site tracking pixels.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-3">5. Your rights</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li>Request access to any personal data we hold about you.</li>
          <li>Request correction or deletion of your data.</li>
          <li>Unsubscribe from communications at any time using the link in any email we send.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm">To exercise any of these rights, write to us via the <a href="/en/contact" class="text-jade hover:underline">contact form</a>. We respond within 48 hours.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-3">6. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p class="text-sm">We may update this policy as the site grows. We'll update the "last updated" date at the top. Major changes will be communicated via email if you're subscribed.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
